QNO 3:
Bank Account Management System

A bank wants to develop a Bank Account Management System using Python, MySQL and Layered Architecture.

Table: account

Field Type
account_no INT
holder_name VARCHAR(50)
balance DECIMAL(10,2)
account_type VARCHAR(20)

Sample Data:

account_no holder_name balance account_type
1001 Amit 25000 Savings
1002 Rahul 40000 Current
1003 Priya 15000 Savings
1004 Neha 55000 Savings
1005 Rohit 30000 Current

Develop a menu-driven Bank Account Management System using the following layered architecture:

database/
connection.py

dao/
account_dao.py

service/
account_service.py

main.py

The application should provide the following operations:

## Create Account

Accept account number, holder name, balance and account type.
Insert the account into the database.

## Update Account

Accept account_no.
Update the holder name and balance.

## Delete Account

Accept account_no.
Delete the account from the database.

## Search Account

Accept account_no.
Display complete account details.
If the account does not exist, display an appropriate message.

## Display All Accounts

Display all account records.
Exit

Architecture Rules

Database connection → Database Layer
SQL queries → DAO Layer
Business logic/validation → Service Layer
Menu and user input/output → Main Layer
Use parameterized queries.
